  {
    "slug": "openai-localization",
    "client": "OpenAI",
    "project": "Localization & RTL Support",
    "year": "2026",
    "description": "Enhanced OpenAI's global accessibility by building a dynamic language selection interface and implementing comprehensive RTL (Right-to-Left) layout support. Successfully launched localized experiences for Arabic, Urdu, and Farsi by auditing and updating dozens of core components, buttons, and interactive elements to ensure pixel-perfect bidirectional rendering and a seamless user experience.",
    "media": "/projects/openai-localization/card.jpg",
    "mediaType": "image",
    "heroMedia": "/projects/openai-localization/hero.jpg",
    "heroMediaType": "image",
    "sections": [
      {
        "type": "intro",
        "techStack": "React, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript",
        "links": [
          {
            "title": "OpenAI",
            "url": "https://www.openai.com"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "wide-media",
        "media": "/projects/openai-localization/hero.jpg",
        "mediaType": "image",
        "contained": false,
        "caption": "",
        "mediaRatio": "900 / 295"
      },
      {
        "type": "wide-media",
        "media": "/projects/openai-localization/screen-1.jpg",
        "mediaType": "image",
        "contained": true,
        "caption": "",
        "mediaRatio": "1044 / 1272"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "To support right-to-left (RTL) languages like Arabic, Urdu, and Farsi without code bloat, I migrated the codebase from rigid physical CSS properties to CSS Logical Properties. To streamline this transition and empower the team for future localization, I engineered custom Tailwind CSS plugins. This allowed us to automatically mirror spacing, borders, and positioning based on the document direction, ensuring a maintainable and highly scalable styling architecture."
      },
      {
        "type": "wide-media",
        "media": "/projects/openai-localization/screen-2.jpg",
        "mediaType": "image",
        "contained": true,
        "caption": "",
        "mediaRatio": "1197 / 894"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Localizing an enterprise application goes deeper than just styling; bidirectional rendering often breaks interactive UI logic. I audited and refactored dozens of core React components, fixing critical JavaScript bugs related to keyboard navigation, sliders, and dynamic dropdowns under RTL conditions. By updating these interactive elements, I ensured that state changes and user inputs remained robust, highly responsive, and visually flawless regardless of language direction."
      },
      {
        "type": "wide-media",
        "media": "/projects/openai-localization/screen-3.jpg",
        "mediaType": "image",
        "contained": true,
        "caption": "",
        "mediaRatio": "2400 / 1800"
      },
      {
        "type": "wide-media",
        "media": "/projects/openai-localization/screen-news.jpg",
        "mediaType": "image",
        "contained": true,
        "caption": "",
        "mediaRatio": "2400 / 1800"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "To support OpenAI's expanding global user base, I built a fully responsive language selection interface featuring built-in search functionality. The component is fully optimized for both desktop and mobile layouts, includes native RTL layout support, and ensures that switching languages never disrupts the user's active session."
      },
      {
        "type": "wide-media",
        "media": "/projects/openai-localization/desktop.png",
        "mediaType": "image",
        "contained": true,
        "caption": "",
        "text": "The different states for the new Language Selector.",
        "mediaRatio": "1641 / 600"
      },
      {
        "type": "wide-media",
        "media": "/projects/openai-localization/mobiles.png",
        "mediaType": "image",
        "contained": true,
        "caption": "",
        "text": "The different states for the new Language Selector on mobile.",
        "mediaRatio": "1700 / 950"
      }
    ],
